description:
Dell all in one desktop computer 24 inch touchscreen featuring impressive 24" FHD IPS Touch display features 99% sRGB and 50% higher contrast within a narrow border so you can enjoy vivid, true-to-life colors as you work, learn or stream;
Dell desktop computers all in one keep your eyes comfortable during long screen sessions with Dell ComfortView Plus, designed to reduce harmful blue light emissions;

Dell desktop computer Windows 11 Pro Laptop with Office 365 One Year suitable for home or business users and professional developers;

Dell all in one computer powered by the Intel Core i7 Processor and fast wireless Wi-Fi 6E for high performance, instant responsiveness to get things done fast;

Dell 24 all in one desktop computer with 5MP+IR HDR Camera with Tilt & Privacy Shutter — Enjoy clear video in any lighting, adjust the angle up to 20°, and push down to hide for instant privacy;

Immerse yourself in loud, clear audio with dual speakers and spatial sound while you’re listening to music, video chatting, or watching a movie;

Dell all in one desktop touchscreen with multipurpose connectivity such as 3-in-1 Media Card Reader, HDMI, Wired Keyboard & Mouse.

1x USB 3.2 Gen 2 Type-C;
3x USB 3.2 Gen 1 (5 Gbps) ports with Wake-up support (S3/Modern Standby);
1x USB 3.2 Gen 2 (10 Gbps) port with PowerShare;
1x HDMI in 1.4;
1x HDMI out 1.4b;
1x RJ-45 Ethernet port;
